@startuml TCSModeFSM 

[*] --> SUM_TCS_INIT_MODE

SUM_TCS_SHUTDOWN_MODE: TRUE for shutdown permission

state SUM_TCS_ACTIVE_MODE{
    SUM_TCS_RUNNING_MODE: Updating time counters
    SUM_TCS_MEMORY_MODE: Save and recovery of data
}

SUM_TCS_INIT_MODE -> SUM_TCS_SHUTDOWN_MODE
SUM_TCS_SHUTDOWN_MODE --> SUM_TCS_RUNNING_MODE: 1. execution requested
SUM_TCS_MEMORY_MODE -> SUM_TCS_RUNNING_MODE: 1. execution requested

SUM_TCS_RUNNING_MODE --> SUM_TCS_MEMORY_MODE: request for shutdown
SUM_TCS_MEMORY_MODE --> SUM_TCS_SHUTDOWN_MODE: 3.execution **not** requested\n//&&//\nmemory request satisfied
SUM_TCS_MEMORY_MODE --> SUM_TCS_MEMORY_MODE: 2. service **not** completed\n//&&//\nretry counter still running

note "memory request satisfied means retry counter is zero or status is E_OK" as N1
@enduml